# Database dumps — real guest PII (names, phone numbers, RSVPs), never commit
# these. Excludes prisma/migrations/ explicitly — those .sql files are
# versioned schema history (no guest data, ever), not dumps, and production
# deploys (`prisma migrate deploy`) need them committed.
*.sql
*.dump
!prisma/migrations/**/*.sql
